{"name":"Giggle","hex":"#eff0d3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"giggle","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To laugh gently in a playful, nervous, or affected manner."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A high-pitched, silly laugh.","Fun; an amusing episode."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/giggle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Laughter","blocks":[{"text":"Laughter is a typically pleasant physical reaction and emotion consisting usually of rhythmical, usually audible contractions of the diaphragm and other parts of the respiratory system. It is a response to certain external or internal stimuli. Laughter can rise from such stimuli as being tickled, or from humorous stories, imagery, videos or thoughts. Most commonly, it is considered an auditory expression of a number of positive emotional states, such as joy, mirth, happiness or relief. On some occasions, however, it may be caused by contrary emotional states such as embarrassment, surprise, or confusion such as nervous laughter or courtesy laugh. Age, gender, education, language and culture are all indicators as to whether a person will experience laughter in a given situation. Other than humans, some other species of primate express laughter-like vocalizations in response to physical contact such as wrestling, play chasing or tickling."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Laughing_boy_at_golden_hour.jpg/330px-Laughing_boy_at_golden_hour.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laughter","wikidata":"Q170579"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Human%E2%80%93canine_friendship_-_smiling_girl_hugging_her_dog_at_golden_hour_in_Laos.jpg/500px-Human%E2%80%93canine_friendship_-_smiling_girl_hugging_her_dog_at_golden_hour_in_Laos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Human%E2%80%93canine_friendship_-_smiling_girl_hugging_her_dog_at_golden_hour_in_Laos.jpg/1280px-Human%E2%80%93canine_friendship_-_smiling_girl_hugging_her_dog_at_golden_hour_in_Laos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Human%E2%80%93canine_friendship_-_smiling_girl_hugging_her_dog_at_golden_hour_in_Laos.jpg/500px-Human%E2%80%93canine_friendship_-_smiling_girl_hugging_her_dog_at_golden_hour_in_Laos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A young girl from Laos laughing while hugging her dog","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHuman%E2%80%93canine_friendship_-_smiling_girl_hugging_her_dog_at_golden_hour_in_Laos.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Laughing_woman.jpg/500px-Laughing_woman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Laughing_woman.jpg/1280px-Laughing_woman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Laughing_woman.jpg/500px-Laughing_woman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A woman laughing","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALaughing_woman.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Laughing_Nyahsa_GalawebDesign.jpg/500px-Laughing_Nyahsa_GalawebDesign.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Laughing_Nyahsa_GalawebDesign.jpg/500px-Laughing_Nyahsa_GalawebDesign.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A man laughing","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALaughing_Nyahsa_GalawebDesign.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikime